  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 708.01 General Operation Requirements. To maintain a standard permit or a transfer facility permit, the operator of a facility or transfer facility shall comply with this part.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 700) ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12349, eff 8-14-17",
